<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-SOTOMAYOR WINS WORLD MEN'S HIGH JUMP TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-SOTOMAYOR WINS WORLD MEN'S HIGH JUMP TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuban Javier Sotomayor won the world men's high jump gold medal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Artur Partyka of Poland took the silver and Australian Tim Forsyth the bronze.</p>
</text>
